3. They understand that the contribution may be distributed under the licensing terms applicable to the iTune project.
4. They grant the project maintainers the permissions necessary to use, modify, maintain, and distribute the contribution as part of the project.

Unless separately agreed in writing, contributors retain copyright ownership of their independently authored contributions.

